sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as Ali brauzeri (tashabbuskor)
  participant S as Server (API + SignalR)
  participant V as Vali brauzeri
  Note over A: X25519 kalit jufti (yopiq kalit extractable: false, IndexedDB)
  A->>S: POST /api/secret-chats {participantId, publicKey}
  Note over S: SecretChat (Pending), Ali sessiyasiga bog'lash
  S-->>V: SecretChatRequested (Valining barcha qurilmalariga)
  Note over V: X25519 kalit jufti
  V->>S: POST /api/secret-chats/{id}/accept {publicKey}
  Note over S: Active, Vali sessiyasiga bog'lash
  S-->>A: SecretChatAccepted {peerPublicKey}
  Note over A,V: Ikkala tomon: X25519(o'z yopiq kaliti, suhbatdosh ochiq kaliti) → HKDF-SHA-256 → ikki zanjir kaliti
  Note over A: messageKey = HMAC(chainKey, 0x01), AES-256-GCM
  A->>S: POST /messages {seq, ciphertext}
  Note over S: seq tekshiruvi (takror bo'lsa 409), blob saqlash
  S-->>V: SecretMessageReceived (faqat Vali qurilmasiga)
  Note over V: Kalitni chiqarish, ochish, IndexedDB ga yozish
  V->>S: POST /ack {upToId}
  Note over S: Blob serverdan o'chiriladi
  Note over A,V: Kalit izi: SHA-256(ikkala ochiq kalit) → 8 emoji, 6×5 raqam — yuzma-yuz solishtiriladi
